      ],
      "text": "Work the beef and the lamb in a bowl with the onion, the parsley, the soaked bread, the cumin, the paprika, the pepper and the salt, squeezing and folding with the hands for a good while, until the mixture is sticky and holds together. Cover and rest it in the cold.",
