      "works_on": ["ingredient/minced-beef", "ingredient/ground-lamb"],
      "with": [],
      "text": "Lay the skewers over glowing coals and turn them often, until the kofte are browned all over and firm to the touch. Check one against a trusted guide to doneness.",
